  "text": "NV7000 - M.2 SSD - Netac NV7000 NV7000 1TB 2TB 4TB • NVMe M.2 PCIe Gen 4 x4 interface • High-quality 3D NAND flash chips • Compact M.2 2280 form factor NV7000 M.2 PCIE SSD New-generation PICe Gen 4×4 high-bandwidth channel, supported by NVMe1.4 protocol FEATURE PICe Gen 4 ×4 & NVMe1.4 protocol Significantly shortens start-up and software loading time and improves PC responsiveness Fast Data Speeds Up to 7200MB/s reading speed and 6850MB/s writing speed, 2-3 times faster than PCIe3.0 SSD Strong Heat Dissipation Performance Equipped with intelligent temperature control technology, which can monitor and regulate the temperature of the components in real time SPECIFICATION Brand Netac Interface M.2 2280 Channel PCIe Gen 4 x4 Capacity 1TB 2TB 4TB Seq. Read（MB/s）up to 7200 7200 7200 Seq. Write（MB/s）up to 5500 6800 6850 TBW 700 1400 3000 NAND Flash 3D NAND Flash Operating Temperature 0℃-70℃ Storage Temperature -40℃-85℃ Size 23.5*80*11.25 mm Warranty 5-year NV7000 netac Datasheet.pdf",
